1a:["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"worker_api_endpoint"}]}]," is the address of the ",["$","em",null,{"children":"scheduler's"}]," ",["$","code",null,{"children":"worker_api"}],"\nservice, the private port from\n",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/configuration/servers-and-services","children":"Servers and services"}],", not the public\none. The worker dials out; the scheduler never dials in. That direction is why\na worker fleet can sit behind NAT with no inbound rules."]}]
1b:["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"cas_fast_slow_store"}]}]," must name a ",["$","code",null,{"children":"fast_slow"}]," store whose ",["$","code",null,{"children":"fast"}]," half is a\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"filesystem"}]," store. The worker builds each action's input tree by hard-linking\nfiles out of that fast store into the work directory, which requires real\nfiles on a real filesystem. The ",["$","code",null,{"children":"slow"}]," half must eventually resolve to the\nsame CAS the client and scheduler use, or be a ",["$","code",null,{"children":"noop"}],", when the fast tier is\nthe only storage."]}]
1c:["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"work_directory"}]}]," must be on the ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"same filesystem"}]," as the fast store's\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"content_path"}],", for the same hard-linking reason. It is fully managed by the\nworker and purged on startup."]}]
1d:["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":"platform_properties"}]}]," is the worker's half of the contract. Each key is\neither a static list of values or a ",["$","code",null,{"children":"query_cmd"}]," that is run (as a command, not\nthrough a shell) each time the worker connects to the scheduler, with its\noutput split on newlines:"]}]
1e:["$","$L8",null,{"className":"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark","style":{"--shiki-light":"#24292e","--shiki-dark":"#e1e4e8","--shiki-light-bg":"#fff","--shiki-dark-bg":"#24292e"},"tabIndex":"0","icon":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M 6,1 C 4.354992,1 3,2.354992 3,4 v 16 c 0,1.645008 1.354992,3 3,3 h 12 c 1.645008,0 3,-1.354992 3,-3 V 8 7 A 1.0001,1.0001 0 0 0 20.707031,6.2929687 l -5,-5 A 1.0001,1.0001 0 0 0 15,1 h -1 z m 0,2 h 7 v 3 c 0,1.645008 1.354992,3 3,3 h 3 v 11 c 0,0.564129 -0.435871,1 -1,1 H 6 C 5.4358712,21 5,20.564129 5,20 V 4 C 5,3.4358712 5.4358712,3 6,3 Z M 15,3.4140625 18.585937,7 H 16 C 15.435871,7 15,6.5641288 15,6 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /></svg>","children":["$","$L9",null,{"children":["$","code",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"line","children":["$","span",null,{"style":{"--shiki-light":"#24292E","--shiki-dark":"#E1E4E8"},"children":"platform_properties: {"}]}],"\n",["$","span",null,{"className":"line","children":[["$","span",null,{"style":{"--shiki-light":"#032F62","--shiki-dark":"#9ECBFF"},"children":"  cpu_count"}],["$","span",null,{"style":{"--shiki-light":"#24292E","--shiki-dark":"#E1E4E8"},"children":": { "}],["$","span",null,{"style":{"--shiki-light":"#032F62","--shiki-dark":"#9ECBFF"},"children":"query_cmd"}],["$","span",null,{"style":{"--shiki-light":"#24292E","--shiki-dark":"#E1E4E8"},"children":": "}],["$","span",null,{"style":{"--shiki-light":"#032F62","--shiki-dark":"#9ECBFF"},"children":"\"nproc\""}],["$","span",null,{"style":{"--shiki-light":"#24292E","--shiki-dark":"#E1E4E8"},"children":" },"}]]}],"\n",["$","span",null,{"className":"line","children":[["$","span",null,{"style":{"--shiki-light":"#032F62","--shiki-dark":"#9ECBFF"},"children":"  OSFamily"}],["$","span",null,{"style":{"--shiki-light":"#24292E","--shiki-dark":"#E1E4E8"},"children":": { "}],["$","span",null,{"style":{"--shiki-light":"#032F62","--shiki-dark":"#9ECBFF"},"children":"values"}],["$","span",null,{"style":{"--shiki-light"